WEBVTT

00:03.250 --> 00:05.730
Why is Shadow-sama...

00:08.300 --> 00:10.640
He knew everything the whole time.

00:10.740 --> 00:13.190
What do you mean, Alpha-sama?

00:13.690 --> 00:16.710
Our real enemy isn't class 2.

00:16.710 --> 00:21.510
Then there's something you can do too, right?

00:21.510 --> 00:22.320
Yup.

00:23.070 --> 00:24.030
Alpha-san...

00:24.850 --> 00:26.080
Raphtalia...

00:28.920 --> 00:34.100
Episode 11: Melody! Music Festival

00:35.670 --> 00:36.360
Indeed.

00:40.100 --> 00:41.640
I...

00:41.640 --> 00:44.150
I praise the Lord's name.

00:43.080 --> 00:44.150
No...

00:44.150 --> 00:46.250
Glory eternal and unchanging.

00:46.250 --> 00:47.010
We...

00:46.250 --> 00:47.730
Unending truths.

00:48.000 --> 00:52.530
We believe in your victory and sing of our joy.

00:49.010 --> 00:50.090
Are...

00:52.530 --> 00:53.910
Atomic.

00:56.170 --> 01:01.820
Let us all leap forward,

00:56.270 --> 00:58.380
Breath of Magic Caster.

00:58.380 --> 00:59.770
Magic Boost.

01:00.170 --> 01:01.450
Greater Luck.

01:01.840 --> 01:03.520
Greater Full Potential.

01:02.440 --> 01:07.720
with a vow in our hearts.

01:03.980 --> 01:05.500
Sensor Boost.

01:05.500 --> 01:07.090
Infinity Wall.

01:07.090 --> 01:08.890
Sanctuary Protection.

01:08.480 --> 01:14.480
Waving our hands, we go forward,

01:09.250 --> 01:10.730
Discern Enemy.

01:10.730 --> 01:12.250
Life Essence.

01:12.250 --> 01:13.860
Mana Essence.

01:13.860 --> 01:14.690
Slow.

01:14.690 --> 01:17.410
Resistance From Magical Weapons.

01:14.850 --> 01:22.800
into each of our own worlds.

01:17.410 --> 01:19.190
Greater Magic Shield.

01:19.190 --> 01:20.980
Paranormal Intuition.

01:20.980 --> 01:22.540
Indomitability.

01:23.160 --> 01:24.340
Greater Hardening.

01:23.760 --> 01:24.940
Reinhart!

01:24.730 --> 01:25.670
Freedom.

01:24.940 --> 01:28.230
At times like this, you want a 
song that fires you up, right?

01:25.670 --> 01:27.270
Penetrate Up.

01:27.270 --> 01:28.700
Bless Wall.

01:28.230 --> 01:29.300
Subaru!

01:28.700 --> 01:30.210
Mantle of Chaos.

01:30.210 --> 01:31.790
Dragonic Power.

01:30.810 --> 01:33.550
Everyone, the enemy is powerful!

01:31.790 --> 01:32.950
Heavenly Aura.

01:33.200 --> 01:34.550
Absorption.

01:33.550 --> 01:34.780
Do your best!

01:34.550 --> 01:36.550
Body of Effulgent Beryl.

01:35.150 --> 01:36.680
Let's give 'em hell!

01:36.680 --> 01:38.400
Yay!

01:44.140 --> 01:45.910
Here we go!

01:46.210 --> 01:48.020
Let's go, everyone.

01:48.920 --> 01:52.570
Now let us go on a journey,

01:52.790 --> 01:56.640
with feelings in our hearts.

01:56.640 --> 02:00.520
The sound of the bell awakens us...

02:00.520 --> 02:01.770
To a world...

02:01.770 --> 02:03.560
We've never seen!

02:03.560 --> 02:07.600
To the future we desire...

02:04.350 --> 02:06.270
Let's go, Aqua!

02:06.270 --> 02:09.520
Go!

02:09.520 --> 02:12.580
Sacred Exorcism!

02:16.810 --> 02:18.780
Holding our will high...

02:18.780 --> 02:19.850
Stretching out our hands...

02:19.850 --> 02:22.680
Barusu! Go struggle and flail!

02:20.190 --> 02:22.680
Freedom, hope. Struggling and flailing.

02:22.680 --> 02:24.040
Leave it to me!

02:24.390 --> 02:30.480
To an era where that's one way to live!

02:30.930 --> 02:31.930
Did we get it?

02:31.930 --> 02:34.240
No, it's a zombie.

02:34.240 --> 02:36.470
And you know what that means.

02:47.440 --> 02:48.790
Beatrice-chan!

02:48.790 --> 02:50.530
You owe me, you know.

02:50.630 --> 02:54.290
Let us go search for the future...

02:54.520 --> 02:56.340
Lady Rem...

02:56.340 --> 02:59.210
Megumin, give up on doing an incantation.

02:59.210 --> 03:00.640
I refuse!

03:00.640 --> 03:04.640
Believe in your will and vow to yourself!

03:04.640 --> 03:07.660
The sorrow and aching of loss...

03:07.660 --> 03:09.390
Don't flee from it.

03:09.390 --> 03:10.420
Splendid!

03:11.120 --> 03:16.240
A wonderful world that binds it all...

03:16.240 --> 03:18.000
...together!

03:18.510 --> 03:21.970
It'll keep regenerating 
until we destroy its core!

03:21.970 --> 03:23.130
Everyone!

03:23.490 --> 03:26.180
This is a modified dodgeball 
that brings your magic together.

03:26.180 --> 03:28.030
Can you use it?

03:28.030 --> 03:30.680
Right! If we put our magic into that...

03:30.680 --> 03:31.570
Kazuma.

03:31.570 --> 03:32.980
Yes, I'm Kazuma.

03:32.980 --> 03:35.690
I've heard you're very good with a drain spell.

03:35.690 --> 03:37.540
I have a bad feeling about this.

03:37.860 --> 03:39.260
What's going on?

03:39.260 --> 03:43.030
Meetings, partings, past, future...

03:39.640 --> 03:41.570
We're gathering together magic.

03:41.570 --> 03:43.030
I mean the way it looks.

03:43.030 --> 03:48.870
Blessing them all...

03:43.780 --> 03:45.700
But how do we get the magic to Ains?

03:45.700 --> 03:48.870
From here on out, it's all about spirit!

03:48.870 --> 03:52.790
Let's go on a journey, 
feelings racing in our heart.

03:52.790 --> 03:56.040
Let's leap forward with a vow in our hearts.

03:56.040 --> 03:59.750
Waving to one another, the paths we follow...

03:59.750 --> 04:09.220
...lead us to our own worlds, 
where everyone can shine!

04:38.240 --> 04:40.800
It's time to announce the winner!

04:42.940 --> 04:45.410
Congratulations to the Winners

04:45.470 --> 04:48.490
You did well.

04:48.490 --> 04:50.210
Thanks so much!

04:52.240 --> 04:54.710
It's because everyone worked together!

04:54.010 --> 04:55.890
We did it!

04:55.890 --> 04:58.760
I should've known class 2 would win.

04:55.890 --> 04:59.010
I'm so glad I was able to lead everyone!

04:59.010 --> 05:01.860
Well, we can't expect to win after that.

05:00.950 --> 05:02.660
I did the conducting!

05:02.160 --> 05:07.780
Reinhart, you didn't use your grace that lets someone else steal the show, right?

05:03.890 --> 05:05.430
Did you all hear me?

05:05.430 --> 05:06.520
Um...

05:07.780 --> 05:09.920
I couldn't say.

05:12.050 --> 05:14.690
We in class 1 were the victors in shadow.

05:14.690 --> 05:16.770
You're right, Alpha.

05:16.770 --> 05:17.690
That's right.

05:19.090 --> 05:21.120
Fine, then.

05:23.740 --> 05:27.010
Wiz-sensei, why are you all fried?

05:27.010 --> 05:32.050
Because she was the one behind all this.

05:33.110 --> 05:37.140
Hmph... burying the pasta zombies 
in the morning glory garden?

05:37.140 --> 05:42.140
I just wanted to give them a 
proper burial, as fellow undead.

05:40.950 --> 05:44.620
You underestimated how 
chaotic this world can be!

05:44.620 --> 05:45.520
But...

05:46.760 --> 05:51.710
Our crazy school life is at an end...

05:47.190 --> 05:49.560
It's so big.

05:49.560 --> 05:51.920
Let me hold it!

05:51.850 --> 05:53.540
Rerugen-sensei...

05:51.920 --> 05:54.410
Can I go inside it then?

05:55.170 --> 05:56.780
Are you sure about that?

05:57.100 --> 05:59.730
What does that mean, Vanir-sensei?

05:59.730 --> 06:02.180
All right...

06:02.620 --> 06:07.790
It's time for what everyone's 
been waiting for, the prize!

06:11.040 --> 06:14.590
What's the radius of effect of that button?

06:14.590 --> 06:17.010
About as far as you can
 hear the sound, perhaps?

06:17.010 --> 06:20.520
Shouldn't we go grab class 1 and Yunyun, too?

06:21.060 --> 06:21.740
Me?

06:21.910 --> 06:24.950
Wait, doesn't that mean that 
it didn't matter who won?

06:25.900 --> 06:27.340
Now, now.

06:26.430 --> 06:28.900
No, that's not true.

06:26.430 --> 06:32.560
Congratulations to the Winners

06:27.340 --> 06:31.810
We got to hear a good 
performance, so it all worked out.

06:32.200 --> 06:34.380
Ros-cchi, you jerk!

06:34.380 --> 06:36.500
It's a waste of time to get angry at him.

06:36.500 --> 06:38.240
Yeah, you're right.

06:38.640 --> 06:41.780
Okay, class 1, Yunyun,
all of you get over here!

06:42.780 --> 06:45.160
Naofumi, why are you off in the corner?

06:45.160 --> 06:46.710
I'm fine here.

06:46.980 --> 06:49.710
If you can't hear the sound, 
it'll be really bad.

06:47.270 --> 06:48.980
Hey, don't drag me!

06:50.710 --> 06:53.640
Hey, Cid Kagenou, you get over here too!

06:54.580 --> 06:57.450
You've got an eye for the small things, Kazuma.

06:57.110 --> 07:00.120
Stop it! Emilia-san!

06:57.450 --> 06:59.360
You can praise me more if you want.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.010
Roswaal.

07:02.390 --> 07:03.510
Hm?

07:02.680 --> 07:05.310
Oh, no! Megumin fell over again!

07:05.310 --> 07:07.790
What happens if we push this button?

07:05.310 --> 07:07.790
Megumin-san, stand up, now.

07:07.790 --> 07:10.880
Rem-san, why are you really 
mean all of a sudden?

07:09.610 --> 07:13.560
You'll have to push it to find out.

07:10.880 --> 07:13.560
Sorry, I just wanted to say it.

07:14.380 --> 07:21.910
I pray it ends in the result 
that you, and I, want.

07:28.280 --> 07:30.840
Ains, Kazuma, Tanya.

07:30.840 --> 07:33.140
It feels like it's been a 
long time, but it hasn't.

07:33.140 --> 07:34.750
Thanks for everything.

07:35.090 --> 07:38.270
It feels kind of strange 
when you say it like that.

07:38.950 --> 07:44.610
You know, I've been thinking that Tanya 
should be more honest about how she feels.

07:44.610 --> 07:48.690
Kazuma, are you saying that 
when you know who I really am?

07:48.690 --> 07:51.940
I mean a little girl should 
act like a little girl.

07:51.940 --> 07:54.580
Were you just talking about me?

07:54.580 --> 07:54.960
Nope!

07:55.290 --> 07:57.280
Oh, we sure were!

07:57.280 --> 08:01.050
You're my little girl, Bea-ko!

08:01.050 --> 08:03.010
Of course I am!

08:07.310 --> 08:08.790
What's wrong, Ains?

08:10.440 --> 08:11.240
Nothing.

08:12.140 --> 08:14.750
Are you sad to say goodbye to us?

08:15.080 --> 08:16.850
Yes, I am.

08:17.290 --> 08:19.360
Assuming we really won't see each other again.

08:21.820 --> 08:23.290
What do you mean?

08:23.290 --> 08:25.500
Oh, well...

08:25.920 --> 08:26.780
You know.

08:27.320 --> 08:29.710
We may see each other again someday.

08:30.130 --> 08:32.690
Come on, that's impossible.

08:33.000 --> 08:35.570
No, maybe it's not.

08:37.170 --> 08:38.720
True.

08:41.930 --> 08:43.330
Huh? Me?

08:44.300 --> 08:48.900
You're the only one who's 
never pushed a button before.

08:49.120 --> 08:53.330
Yeah, you need to unlock the 
"push the button" achievement.

08:53.330 --> 08:55.840
Is that a noteworthy achievement?

08:55.840 --> 08:57.910
He's talking about a video game.

08:57.910 --> 09:00.290
More video games...

09:00.730 --> 09:02.260
Now, Subaru!

09:14.620 --> 09:17.100
Time to push it, I guess!

09:18.390 --> 09:21.510
Everybody, are you ready?

09:21.510 --> 09:22.940
Yup!

09:23.870 --> 09:25.140
Let's go!

09:25.140 --> 09:26.380
Three...

09:26.990 --> 09:28.430
Two...

09:28.940 --> 09:30.390
One...!

09:43.910 --> 09:44.730
Huh?

09:45.620 --> 09:48.010
Nothing happened.

09:48.010 --> 09:49.290
Is it broken?

09:49.290 --> 09:53.510
I definitely heard a sound inside my head.

09:56.470 --> 09:57.820
What's wrong?

09:57.820 --> 09:59.570
Nothing happened!

09:59.570 --> 10:01.450
Did you make sure you pushed it?

10:01.990 --> 10:03.220
You idiot!

10:06.380 --> 10:08.770
Someone get that button away from Aqua!

10:08.770 --> 10:09.920
Why?

10:09.920 --> 10:13.470
It's broken! Who cares if I've got it?

10:13.470 --> 10:18.450
Even if it's broken, you 
might break it even more!

10:18.450 --> 10:19.450
Albedo!

10:19.450 --> 10:20.660
Leave it to me!

10:21.030 --> 10:23.340
Huh? W-Wait!

10:23.340 --> 10:25.160
Violence is wrong!

10:25.750 --> 10:29.410
Don't worry! I'm only going 
to hurt you in a friendly way.

10:26.070 --> 10:29.410
What even was that button?

10:29.880 --> 10:35.080
I don't know. The whole mountain got
 in an uproar over a single rat, I guess.

10:35.080 --> 10:36.860
That's a saying from our world.

10:41.810 --> 10:43.670
Ram, help me!

10:49.460 --> 10:52.620
Yeah, that's right. So that's what's going on.

10:53.550 --> 10:55.840
What's wrong, Ains?

10:55.840 --> 10:57.140
Did you eat something weird?

10:57.140 --> 11:00.710
I can't even eat.

11:00.710 --> 11:02.490
Ains is the same as ever.

11:02.850 --> 11:05.060
Kazuma-san!

11:05.060 --> 11:07.210
Yes, I'm Kazuma!

11:06.510 --> 11:12.990
So we're stuck in this weird 
world for a little more, huh?

11:13.450 --> 11:14.810
That's right.

11:14.810 --> 11:16.950
Well, I guess that's okay.

11:16.950 --> 11:23.730
But you all don't mind 
this world so much, do you?

11:24.110 --> 11:25.450
That's true.
